AF][/dim]A whole capture item `++[N]` / `--[N]` moves today's running [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Pomodoro N five-minute units later / earlier exactly like [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Obsidian's `N\\o` / `N\\O`, every Pomodoro session operator's count [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]is optional and defaults to 1 (so `+`, `-`, `++`, and `--` all [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]work), and Bob CLI and Bob Mac Capture preview and apply these [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]operators with identical, atomic results.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]pomodoro_shift_operators.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/pomodoro_shift_operators.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-2a[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-2a/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Parse and atomically apply Pomodoro session shifts[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]shift_core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]shift_core: add the unified whole-item session-operator lexer (one sign [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resizes, two signs shift, count defaults to 1), the PomodoroShift [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture kind, a staged planner that translates the running session's [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]start and end like `N\\o`/`N\\O`, additive `pomodoro_shift` capture JSON [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plus human output, and CLI integration tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Expose and document the session-operator contract[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]editor_contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shift_core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]editor_contract: surface `pomodoro_shift` mode, span, spec, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]diagnostics in capture-parse, make bare `+`/`-`/`++`/`--` complete [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]editor states, keep completion/rewrite/`@@` away from operator items, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and update every help text, docs/capture.md, and README with protocol [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Preview and submit session shifts in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]          [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac_shift[dim] · [dim][/dim]after editor_contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac_shift: decode the shift spec/summary tolerantly, add a pure shift [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]presentation with a double-chevron row, name the footer action, carry [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]shifts into notifications and the Pomodoro palette, guarantee literal [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ASCII hyphens in the editor, and cover it with real-bob fixtures, tests,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]README, and green macOS CI.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-2a","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-2a.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-64647a0fe84f12cff8db0578e8872c0d","started_at":"2026-09-28T14:36:17.330410+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"3cd05a8847a6e71577beded7a1ea8a4d915b087058ae4bcd8404cf166471bfc0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2a.3/chat.md","size_bytes":3080},"commits":{"digest":"89f6394a6866b75aa3b4f9f51c17f847b7ac94ec169e650af2019538d9197c51","path":"agents/bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-2a.